The MediaEngine patch adapts autoplay, stream attributes/selection and frame
bridging changes from GE-Proton commit 88af667340f311b380357da1f46bb25e1ec30938,
with local transfer bounds and buffer layout checks. The WineGStreamer patch
falls back to system-memory NV12 samples only when D3D allocation reports
E_INVALIDARG. Diagnostic instrumentation is not included.

Only mfmediaengine.dll and winegstreamer.dll in the managed private Proton tool
are replaced. Original Steam/Proton files and the WineGStreamer Unix module are
unchanged. The existing camera and FFmpeg components retain their own notices.
